flowchart TB
  subgraph Frontend[React frontend]
    Pages[Feature pages]
    Client[Typed API client]
    State[Session and UI state]
    Pages --> Client
    Pages --> State
  end
  subgraph Backend[NestJS modular monolith]
    Guards[Auth and permission guards]
    Controllers[REST controllers]
    Services[Business services]
    Prisma[Prisma data access]
    Modules[Auth / Users / Catalogue / Inventory / Purchases / Sales / Warranty / Reports / Audit]
    Guards --> Controllers --> Services --> Prisma
    Modules --- Controllers
    Modules --- Services
  end
  DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  Client <-->|HTTPS| Guards
  Prisma --> DB
